{
  "openapi": "3.1.0",
  "info": {
    "title": "Task Manager API",
    "version": "1.0.0",
    "description": "Machine-readable OpenAPI 3.1 specification for the Task Manager API.\n\n## Overview\nThis document describes every public HTTP endpoint exposed by the service, including request/response schemas, worked examples, authentication requirements, and error scenarios aligned with the application's `AppError` taxonomy.\n\n## Authentication\nMost endpoints require a bearer token. Obtain a token from `POST /api/auth/login` and send it in the `Authorization` header:\n\n```\nAuthorization: Bearer <token>\n```\n\n## Error model\nAll errors are returned as JSON with the following shape:\n\n```json\n{\n  \"error\": {\n    \"code\": \"VALIDATION_ERROR\",\n    \"message\": \"Human readable message\",\n    \"details\": [ { \"field\": \"email\", \"message\": \"must be a valid email\" } ],\n    \"requestId\": \"b3f1c2a4-...\"\n  }\n}\n```\n\nThe `code` field is drawn from the `AppError` taxonomy:\n\n| Code | HTTP status | Meaning |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| `VALIDATION_ERROR` | 400 | Request body/query failed validation |\n| `UNAUTHORIZED` | 401 | Missing or invalid credentials/token |\n| `FORBIDDEN` | 403 | Authenticated but not allowed |\n| `NOT_FOUND` | 404 | Resource does not exist |\n| `CONFLICT` | 409 | Resource state conflict (e.g. duplicate email) |\n| `RATE_LIMITED` | 429 | Too many requests |\n| `INTERNAL_ERROR` | 500 | Unexpected server error |\n\n## Keeping this document in sync\nThis file is generated from the route definitions and Zod schemas. To regenerate after changing an endpoint:\n\n```bash\nnpm run docs:openapi   # regenerates public/openapi.json\nnpm run docs:lint      # validates the spec against OpenAPI 3.1\n```\n\nCI runs `docs:lint` and fails the build if the committed spec is stale or invalid. Do not hand-edit generated sections; update the source schemas instead.",
    "contact": {
      "name": "API Team",
      "email": "api@example.com"
    },
    "license": {
      "name": "MIT",
      "url": "https://opensource.org/licenses/MIT"
    }
  },
  "servers": [
    {
      "url": "http://localhost:3000",
      "description": "Local development"
    },
    {
      "url": "https://api.example.com",
      "description": "Production"
    }
  ],
  "tags": [
    { "name": "Auth", "description": "Registration, login, and session management" },
    { "name": "Users", "description": "User profile operations" },
    { "name": "Tasks", "description": "Task CRUD operations" },
    { "name": "Health", "description": "Service health and readiness" }
  ],
  "security": [{ "bearerAuth": [] }],
  "paths": {
    "/api/health": {
      "get": {
        "tags": ["Health"],
        "summary": "Service health check",
        "description": "Returns the current health status of the service. Does not require authentication.",
        "operationId": "getHealth",
        "security": [],
        "responses": {
          "200": {
            "description": "Service is healthy",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": { "$ref": "#/components/schemas/HealthResponse" },
                "example": { "status": "ok", "uptime": 12345.67, "version": "1.0.0" }
              }
            }
          },
          "500": { "$ref": "#/components/responses/InternalError" }
        }
      }
    },
    "/api/auth/register": {
      "post": {
        "tags": ["Auth"],
        "summary": "Register a new user",
        "description": "Creates a new user account and returns an access token.",
        "operationId": "registerUser",
        "security": [],
        "requestBody": {
          "required": true,
          "content": {
            "application/json": {
              "schema": { "$ref": "#/components/schemas/RegisterRequest" },
              "example": {
                "email": "jane.doe@example.com",
                "password": "S3cure!Passw0rd",
                "name": "Jane Doe"
              }
            }
          }
        },
        "responses": {
          "201": {
            "description": "User created",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": { "$ref": "#/components/schemas/AuthResponse" },
                "example": {
                  "token": "eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9...",
                  "user": {
                    "id": "usr_01HXYZ",
                    "email": "jane.doe@example.com",
                    "name": "Jane Doe",
                    "createdAt": "2024-01-15T10:30:00.000Z"
                  }
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "400": { "$ref": "#/components/responses/ValidationError" },
          "409": {
            "description": "Email already registered",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": { "$ref": "#/components/schemas/ErrorResponse" },
                "example": {
                  "error": {
                    "code": "CONFLICT",
                    "message": "A user with this email already exists",
                    "requestId": "b3f1c2a4-1f2e-4c3d-9a8b-7e6d5c4b3a21"
                  }
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "429": { "$ref": "#/components/responses/RateLimited" },
          "500": { "$ref": "#/components/responses/InternalError" }
        }
      }
    },
    "/api/auth/login": {
      "post": {
        "tags": ["Auth"],
        "summary": "Log in",
        "description": "Authenticates a user and returns an access token.",
        "operationId": "loginUser",
        "security": [],
        "requestBody": {
          "required": true,
          "content": {
            "application/json": {
              "schema": { "$ref": "#/components/schemas/LoginRequest" },
              "example": {
                "email": "jane.doe@example.com",
                "password": "S3cure!Passw0rd"
              }
            }
          }
        },
        "responses": {
          "200": {
            "description": "Authenticated",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": { "$ref": "#/components/schemas/AuthResponse" },
                "example": {
                  "token": "eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9...",
                  "user": {
                    "id": "usr_01HXYZ",
                    "email": "jane.doe@example.com",
                    "name": "Jane Doe",
                    "createdAt": "2024-01-15T10:30:00.000Z"
                  }
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "400": { "$ref": "#/components/responses/ValidationError" },
          "401": {
            "description": "Invalid credentials",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": { "$ref": "#/components/schemas/ErrorResponse" },
                "example": {
                  "error": {
                    "code": "UNAUTHORIZED",
                    "message": "Invalid email or password",
                    "requestId": "b3f1c2a4-1f2e-4c3d-9a8b-7e6d5c4b3a21"
                  }
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "429": { "$ref": "#/components/responses/RateLimited" },
          "500": { "$ref": "#/components/responses/InternalError" }
        }
      }
    },
    "/api/auth/logout": {
      "post": {
        "tags": ["Auth"],
        "summary": "Log out",
        "description": "Invalidates the current access token.",
        "operationId": "logoutUser",
        "responses": {
          "204": { "description": "Logged out" },
          "401": { "$ref": "#/components/responses/Unauthorized" },
          "500": { "$ref": "#/components/responses/InternalError" }
        }
      }
    },
    "/api/users/me": {
      "get": {
        "tags": ["Users"],
        "summary": "Get current user",
        "description": "Returns the profile of the authenticated user.",
        "operationId": "getCurrentUser",
        "responses": {
          "200": {
            "description": "Current user profile",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": { "$ref": "#/components/schemas/User" },
                "example": {
                  "id": "usr_01HXYZ",
                  "email": "jane.doe@example.com",
                  "name": "Jane Doe",
                  "createdAt": "2024-01-15T10:30:00.000Z"
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "401": { "$ref": "#/components/responses/Unauthorized" },
          "500": { "$ref": "#/components/responses/InternalError" }
        }
      },
      "patch": {
        "tags": ["Users"],
        "summary": "Update current user",
        "description": "Updates the profile of the authenticated user.",
        "operationId": "updateCurrentUser",
        "requestBody": {
          "required": true,
          "content": {
            "application/json": {
              "schema": { "$ref": "#/components/schemas/UpdateUserRequest" },
              "example": { "name": "Jane Q. Doe" }
            }
          }
        },
        "responses": {
          "200": {
            "description": "Updated user profile",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": { "$ref": "#/components/schemas/User" },
                "example": {
                  "id": "usr_01HXYZ",
                  "email": "jane.doe@example.com",
                  "name": "Jane Q. Doe",
                  "createdAt": "2024-01-15T10:30:00.000Z"
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "400": { "$ref": "#/components/responses/ValidationError" },
          "401": { "$ref": "#/components/responses/Unauthorized" },
          "500": { "$ref": "#/components/responses/InternalError" }
        }
      }
    },
    "/api/tasks": {
      "get": {
        "tags": ["Tasks"],
        "summary": "List tasks",
        "description": "Returns a paginated list of tasks belonging to the authenticated user.",
        "operationId": "listTasks",
        "parameters": [
          {
            "name": "status",
            "in": "query",
            "description": "Filter by task status",
            "required": false,
            "schema": { "$ref": "#/components/schemas/TaskStatus" }
          },
          {
            "name": "page",
            "in": "query",
            "description": "Page number (1-based)",
            "required": false,
            "schema": { "type": "integer", "minimum": 1, "default": 1 }
          },
          {
            "name": "limit",
            "in": "query",
            "description": "Page size",
            "required": false,
            "schema": { "type": "integer", "minimum": 1, "maximum": 100, "default": 20 }
          }
        ],
        "responses": {
          "200": {
            "description": "Paginated task list",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": { "$ref": "#/components/schemas/TaskListResponse" },
                "example": {
                  "data": [
                    {
                      "id": "tsk_01HABC",
                      "title": "Write documentation",
                      "description": "Add OpenAPI spec",
                      "status": "in_progress",
                      "dueDate": "2024-02-01T00:00:00.000Z",
                      "createdAt": "2024-01-15T10:30:00.000Z",
                      "updatedAt": "2024-01-16T09:00:00.000Z"
                    }
                  ],
                  "meta": { "page": 1, "limit": 20, "total": 1, "totalPages": 1 }
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "400": { "$ref": "#/components/responses/ValidationError" },
          "401": { "$ref": "#/components/responses/Unauthorized" },
          "500": { "$ref": "#/components/responses/InternalError" }
        }
      },
      "post": {
        "tags": ["Tasks"],
        "summary": "Create a task",
        "description": "Creates a new task for the authenticated user.",
        "operationId": "createTask",
        "requestBody": {
          "required": true,
          "content": {
            "application/json": {
              "schema": { "$ref": "#/components/schemas/CreateTaskRequest" },
              "example": {
                "title": "Write documentation",
                "description": "Add OpenAPI spec",
                "status": "todo",
                "dueDate": "2024-02-01T00:00:00.000Z"
              }
            }
          }
        },
        "responses": {
          "201": {
            "description": "Task created",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": { "$ref": "#/components/schemas/Task" },
                "example": {
                  "id": "tsk_01HABC",
                  "title": "Write documentation",
                  "description": "Add OpenAPI spec",
                  "status": "todo",
                  "dueDate": "2024-02-01T00:00:00.000Z",
                  "createdAt": "2024-01-15T10:30:00.000Z",
                  "updatedAt": "2024-01-15T10:30:00.000Z"
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "400": { "$ref": "#/components/responses/ValidationError" },
          "401": { "$ref": "#/components/responses/Unauthorized" },
          "500": { "$ref": "#/components/responses/InternalError" }
        }
      }
    },
    "/api/tasks/{id}": {
      "parameters": [
        {
          "name": "id",
          "in": "path",
          "required": true,
          "description": "Task identifier",
          "schema": { "type": "string", "example": "tsk_01HABC" }
        }
      ],
      "get": {
        "tags": ["Tasks"],
        "summary": "Get a task",
        "description": "Returns a single task by id.",
        "operationId": "getTask",
        "responses": {
          "200": {
            "description": "Task",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": { "$ref": "#/components/schemas/Task" },
                "example": {
                  "id": "tsk_01HABC",
                  "title": "Write documentation",
                  "description": "Add OpenAPI spec",
                  "status": "in_progress",
                  "dueDate": "2024-02-01T00:00:00.000Z",
                  "createdAt": "2024-01-15T10:30:00.000Z",
                  "updatedAt": "2024-01-16T09:00:00.000Z"
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "401": { "$ref": "#/components/responses/Unauthorized" },
          "403": { "$ref": "#/components/responses/Forbidden" },
          "404": { "$ref": "#/components/responses/NotFound" },
          "500": { "$ref": "#/components/responses/InternalError" }
        }
      },
      "patch": {
        "tags": ["Tasks"],
        "summary": "Update a task",
        "description": "Partially updates a task.",
        "operationId": "updateTask",
        "requestBody": {
          "required": true,
          "content": {
            "application/json": {
              "schema": { "$ref": "#/components/schemas/UpdateTaskRequest" },
              "example": { "status": "done" }
            }
          }
        },
        "responses": {
          "200": {
            "description": "Updated task",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": { "$ref": "#/components/schemas/Task" },
                "example": {
                  "id": "tsk_01HABC",
                  "title": "Write documentation",
                  "description": "Add OpenAPI spec",
                  "status": "done",
                  "dueDate": "2024-02-01T00:00:00.000Z",
                  "createdAt": "2024-01-15T10:30:00.000Z",
                  "updatedAt": "2024-01-17T12:00:00.000Z"
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "400": { "$ref": "#/components/responses/ValidationError" },
          "401": { "$ref": "#/components/responses/Unauthorized" },
          "403": { "$ref": "#/components/responses/Forbidden" },
          "404": { "$ref": "#/components/responses/NotFound" },
          "500": { "$ref": "#/components/responses/InternalError" }
        }
      },
      "delete": {
        "tags": ["Tasks"],
        "summary": "Delete a task",
        "description": "Deletes a task by id.",
        "operationId": "deleteTask",
        "responses": {
          "204": { "description": "Task deleted" },
          "401": { "$ref": "#/components/responses/Unauthorized" },
          "403": { "$ref": "#/components/responses/Forbidden" },
          "404": { "$ref": "#/components/responses/NotFound" },
          "500": { "$ref": "#/components/responses/InternalError" }
        }
      }
    }
  },
  "components": {
    "securitySchemes": {
      "bearerAuth": {
        "type": "http",
        "scheme": "bearer",
        "bearerFormat": "JWT",
        "description": "JWT access token obtained from `POST /api/auth/login`."
      }
    },
    "schemas": {
      "HealthResponse": {
        "type": "object",
        "required": ["status", "uptime", "version"],
        "properties": {
          "status": { "type": "string", "enum": ["ok", "degraded"], "example": "ok" },
          "uptime": { "type": "number", "description": "Uptime in seconds", "example": 12345.67 },
          "version": { "type": "string", "example": "1.0.0" }
        }
      },
      "RegisterRequest": {
        "type": "object",
        "required": ["email", "password", "name"],
        "properties": {
          "email": { "type": "string", "format": "email", "example": "jane.doe@example.com" },
          "password": {
            "type": "string",
            "minLength": 8,
            "description": "Must contain at least one letter and one number",
            "example": "S3cure!Passw0rd"
          },
          "name": { "type": "string", "minLength": 1, "maxLength": 100, "example": "Jane Doe" }
        }
      },
      "LoginRequest": {
        "type": "object",
        "required": ["email", "password"],
        "properties": {
          "email": { "type": "string", "format": "email", "example": "jane.doe@example.com" },
          "password": { "type": "string", "example": "S3cure!Passw0rd" }
        }
      },
      "AuthResponse": {
        "type": "object",
        "required": ["token", "user"],
        "properties": {
          "token": { "type": "string", "description": "JWT access token", "example": "eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9..." },
          "user": { "$ref": "#/components/schemas/User" }
        }
      },
      "User": {
        "type": "object",
        "required": ["id", "email", "name", "createdAt"],
        "properties": {
          "id": { "type": "string", "example": "usr_01HXYZ" },
          "email": { "type": "string", "format": "email", "example": "jane.doe@example.com" },
          "name": { "type": "string", "example": "Jane Doe" },
          "createdAt": { "type": "string", "format": "date-time", "example": "2024-01-15T10:30:00.000Z" }
        }
      },
      "UpdateUserRequest": {
        "type": "object",
        "minProperties": 1,
        "properties": {
          "name": { "type": "string", "minLength": 1, "maxLength": 100, "example": "Jane Q. Doe" }
        }
      },
      "TaskStatus": {
        "type": "string",
        "enum": ["todo", "in_progress", "done"],
        "example": "in_progress"
      },
      "Task": {
        "type": "object",
        "required": ["id", "title", "status", "createdAt", "updatedAt"],
        "properties": {
          "id": { "type": "string", "example": "tsk_01HABC" },
          "title": { "type": "string", "minLength": 1, "maxLength": 200, "example": "Write documentation" },
          "description": { "type": ["string", "null"], "maxLength": 2000, "example": "Add OpenAPI spec" },
          "status": { "$ref": "#/components/schemas/TaskStatus" },
          "dueDate": { "type": ["string", "null"], "format": "date-time", "example": "2024-02-01T00:00:00.000Z" },
          "createdAt": { "type": "string", "format": "date-time", "example": "2024-01-15T10:30:00.000Z" },
          "updatedAt": { "type": "string", "format": "date-time", "example": "2024-01-16T09:00:00.000Z" }
        }
      },
      "CreateTaskRequest": {
        "type": "object",
        "required": ["title"],
        "properties": {
          "title": { "type": "string", "minLength": 1, "maxLength": 200, "example": "Write documentation" },
          "description": { "type": "string", "maxLength": 2000, "example": "Add OpenAPI spec" },
          "status": { "$ref": "#/components/schemas/TaskStatus" },
          "dueDate": { "type": "string", "format": "date-time", "example": "2024-02-01T00:00:00.000Z" }
        }
      },
      "UpdateTaskRequest": {
        "type": "object",
        "minProperties": 1,
        "properties": {
          "title": { "type": "string", "minLength": 1, "maxLength": 200, "example": "Write documentation" },
          "description": { "type": ["string", "null"], "maxLength": 2000, "example": "Add OpenAPI spec" },
          "status": { "$ref": "#/components/schemas/TaskStatus" },
          "dueDate": { "type": ["string", "null"], "format": "date-time", "example": "2024-02-01T00:00:00.000Z" }
        }
      },
      "TaskListResponse": {
        "type": "object",
        "required": ["data", "meta"],
        "properties": {
          "data": {
            "type": "array",
            "items": { "$ref": "#/components/schemas/Task" }
          },
          "meta": { "$ref": "#/components/schemas/PaginationMeta" }
        }
      },
      "PaginationMeta": {
        "type": "object",
        "required": ["page", "limit", "total", "totalPages"],
        "properties": {
          "page": { "type": "integer", "minimum": 1, "example": 1 },
          "limit": { "type": "integer", "minimum": 1, "example": 20 },
          "total": { "type": "integer", "minimum": 0, "example": 1 },
          "totalPages": { "type": "integer", "minimum": 0, "example": 1 }
        }
      },
      "ErrorResponse": {
        "type": "object",
        "required": ["error"],
        "properties": {
          "error": {
            "type": "object",
            "required": ["code", "message"],
            "properties": {
              "code": {
                "type": "string",
                "description": "AppError taxonomy code",
                "enum": [
                  "VALIDATION_ERROR",
                  "UNAUTHORIZED",
                  "FORBIDDEN",
                  "NOT_FOUND",
                  "CONFLICT",
                  "RATE_LIMITED",
                  "INTERNAL_ERROR"
                ],
                "example": "VALIDATION_ERROR"
              },
              "message": { "type": "string", "example": "Request validation failed" },
              "details": {
                "type": "array",
                "description": "Field-level validation details (only for VALIDATION_ERROR)",
                "items": {
                  "type": "object",
                  "required": ["field", "message"],
                  "properties": {
                    "field": { "type": "string", "example": "email" },
                    "message": { "type": "string", "example": "must be a valid email" }
                  }
                }
              },
              "requestId": { "type": "string", "description": "Correlation id for support", "example": "b3f1c2a4-1f2e-4c3d-9a8b-7e6d5c4b3a21" }
            }
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "responses": {
      "ValidationError": {
        "description": "Request validation failed",
        "content": {
          "application/json": {
            "schema": { "$ref": "#/components/schemas/ErrorResponse" },
            "example": {
              "error": {
                "code": "VALIDATION_ERROR",
                "message": "Request validation failed",
                "details": [
                  { "field": "email", "message": "must be a valid email" },
                  { "field": "password", "message": "must be at least 8 characters" }
                ],
                "requestId": "b3f1c2a4-1f2e-4c3d-9a8b-7e6d5c4b3a21"
              }
            }
          }
        }
      },
      "Unauthorized": {
        "description": "Missing or invalid credentials",
        "content": {
          "application/json": {
            "schema": { "$ref": "#/components/schemas/ErrorResponse" },
            "example": {
              "error": {
                "code": "UNAUTHORIZED",
                "message": "Authentication required",
                "requestId": "b3f1c2a4-1f2e-4c3d-9a8b-7e6d5c4b3a21"
              }
            }
          }
        }
      },
      "Forbidden": {
        "description": "Authenticated but not allowed to access the resource",
        "content": {
          "application/json": {
            "schema": { "$ref": "#/components/schemas/ErrorResponse" },
            "example": {
              "error": {
                "code": "FORBIDDEN",
                "message": "You do not have permission to access this resource",
                "requestId": "b3f1c2a4-1f2e-4c3d-9a8b-7e6d5c4b3a21"
              }
            }
          }
        }
      },
      "NotFound": {
        "description": "Resource not found",
        "content": {
          "application/json": {
            "schema": { "$ref": "#/components/schemas/ErrorResponse" },
            "example": {
              "error": {
                "code": "NOT_FOUND",
                "message": "Task not found",
                "requestId": "b3f1c2a4-1f2e-4c3d-9a8b-7e6d5c4b3a21"
              }
            }
          }
        }
      },
      "RateLimited": {
        "description": "Too many requests",
        "headers": {
          "Retry-After": {
            "description": "Seconds until the next request may be attempted",
            "schema": { "type": "integer", "example": 30 }
          }
        },
        "content": {
          "application/json": {
            "schema": { "$ref": "#/components/schemas/ErrorResponse" },
            "example": {
              "error": {
                "code": "RATE_LIMITED",
                "message": "Too many requests, please try again later",
                "requestId": "b3f1c2a4-1f2e-4c3d-9a8b-7e6d5c4b3a21"
              }
            }
          }
        }
      },
      "InternalError": {
        "description": "Unexpected server error",
        "content": {
          "application/json": {
            "schema": { "$ref": "#/components/schemas/ErrorResponse" },
            "example": {
              "error": {
                "code": "INTERNAL_ERROR",
                "message": "An unexpected error occurred",
                "requestId": "b3f1c2a4-1f2e-4c3d-9a8b-7e6d5c4b3a21"
              }
            }
          }
        }
      }
    }
  }
}